  type_array_err_bound_order_char.pcpp - break step of type_array.pcpp:
  char bounds too: 'Z' is above 'A' (SM0328)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_bound_order_char.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_bound_order_char.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
